  ✓ Perform fidelity checks and independent differential testing
  ✓ Rebuild semantics/proof from clean scratch and rerun all positive claims
  ✓ Audit claim adequacy, real-program pinning, and all K rules statically
  ✓ Run a fresh false-result non-vacuity mutation
  ✓ Account for assumptions/trust boundaries and write REVIEW.md with final verdict
